sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor OP as Operator
  participant M as Manager
  participant C as config.py
  participant TG as Taskgraph
  participant B as brief.py
  participant W as Worker
  participant V as Verifier

  M->>C: check
  C-->>M: ok
  M->>TG: ready, show 41
  M->>B: --task 41 --keyword sweep
  B->>TG: show 41 (notes, scope, verify)
  B->>C: load config
  B-->>M: .agentic-team/briefs/task-41-1.md (with the result add command)
  M->>C: model implementation
  C-->>M: sonnet, effort high
  M->>W: claude --bg --worktree task-41-1 --name task-41-1-sweep --agent agentic-team:worker
  M->>TG: start 41, meta session, model, attempt
  Note over M: Manager launches other tasks meanwhile
  W->>TG: commit, then result add 41 PASS (Branch, Head, Worktree)
  Note over M: Next drain point
  M->>TG: result ls 41
  M->>V: claude --bg --worktree verify-41-1, brief pinned to Head SHA
  V->>TG: result add 41 --kind verify, Verdict: test-verified
  M->>TG: meta verdict, verdict_ref, tokens
  M->>TG: done 41
  Note over M: After the merge: tg edit merged_at, then claude rm
  M->>OP: Status report, open gates, branch ready to merge
